<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Java Tutorial | W3Schools Clone</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #ffffff;
    }

    .navbar {
      background-color: #282A35;
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      padding: 15px 40px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .navbar a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .navbar a:first-child {
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #04AA6D;
    }

    .navbar a:hover {
      color: #04AA6D;
    }

    .container {
      display: flex;
      min-height: calc(100vh - 60px - 60px); /* minus navbar and footer height */
    }

    .sidebar {
      width: 250px;
      background-color: #f1f1f1;
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: 2px 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .sidebar h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .sidebar a {
      display: block;
      padding: 10px;
      color: #000;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
    }

    .sidebar a:hover {
      background-color: #ddd;
      color: #04AA6D;
    }

    .content {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 40px;
      background-color: #fff;
    }

    .content h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: #282A35;
    }

    .content p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    footer {
      background-color: #282A35;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .container {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .sidebar {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .navbar {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 10px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Header -->
  <nav class="navbar">
    <a href="/">W3C</a>
    <a href="#">Tutorials</a>
    <a href="#">References</a>
    <a href="#">Exercises</a>
    <a href="#">Videos</a>
  </nav>

  <!-- Main Layout -->
  <div class="container">

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <h3>Java Tutorial</h3>
      <a href="/java/intro">Java Intro</a>
      <a href="/java/datatypes">Data Types</a>
      <a href="/java/variables">Variables</a>
      <a href="/java/object">Object</a>
      <a href="/java/classes">Classes</a>
      <a href="/java/inheritance">Inheritance</a>
      <a href="/java/polymorphism">Polymorphism</a>
      <a href="/java/abstraction">Abstraction</a>
      <a href="/java/encapsulation">Encapsulation</a>
    </aside>

    <!-- Content -->
    <main class="content">
      <h1>Java Tutorial</h1>
      <p>Welcome to the Java tutorial section of our W3Schools Clone! Here you will learn everything about Java programming — from basics to advanced concepts.</p>
      <p>Click on a topic on the left to get started.</p>
    </main>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer>
    <p>W3Schools Clone - © 2025</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
